# The scenario's constants, read by compose when it brings the stack up and by
# the test when it works out what to expect. One fact, one place: a test that
# hardcoded the threshold would keep passing after the fixture changed, and
# would be asserting on a number nothing sets.
#
# How many restarts without recovery autoheal tolerates before it gives up.
# Low on purpose -- the tests wait for it to be reached, and three restarts at
# a one-second poll is a long time to sit in a test for no extra confidence.
CRASHLOOP_STRIKES=2
